! Start detailed HVAC data definition



Sizing:System,
   Air Loop,                                                                                           ! - Name of loop
   Sensible,                                                                                           ! - Type of load to size on
   autosize,                                                                                           ! - Design outdoor air flow rate (m3/s)
   1.00,                                                                                               ! - Minimum sytem air flow ratio
   5.00,                                                                                               ! - Preheat design temperature (C)
   0.00800,                                                                                            ! - Preheat design humidity ratio (kg-H20/kg-air)
   11.00,                                                                                              ! - Precool design temperature (C)
   0.00800,                                                                                            ! - Precool design humidity ratio (kg-H20/kg-air)
   14.00,                                                                                              ! - Central cooling design supply air temperature (C)
   50.00,                                                                                              ! - Central heating design supply air temperature (C)
   Noncoincident,                                                                                      ! - Sizing option
   No,                                                                                                 ! - 100% outdoor air in cooling
   No,                                                                                                 ! - 100% outdoor air in heating
   0.00800,                                                                                            ! - Central cooling design supply air humidity ratio (kg-H20/kg-air)
   0.00800,                                                                                            ! - Central heating design supply air humidity ratio (kg-H20/kg-air)
   Designday,                                                                                          ! - Cooling design air flow method
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Cooling design air flow rate (m3/s)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Supply air flow rate per floor area during cooling operation (m3/s-m2)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Fraction of auto-sized design cooling supply air flow rate
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Design supply air flow rate per unit cooling capacity (m3/s-W)
   Designday,                                                                                          ! - Heating design air flow method
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Heating design air flow rate (m3/s)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Supply air flow rate per floor area during heating operation (m3/s-m2)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Fraction of auto-sized design heating supply air flow rate
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Fraction of auto-sized design cooling supply air flow rate
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Design supply air flow rate per unit heating capacity (m3/s-W)
   ZoneSum,                                                                                            ! - System outdoor air method
   1.0000,                                                                                             ! - Zone maximum outdoor air fraction
   CoolingDesignCapacity,                                                                              ! - Cooling design capacity method
   autosize,                                                                                           ! - Cooling design capacity (W)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Cooling design capacity per floor area (W/m2)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Fraction of auto-sized cooling capacity
   HeatingDesignCapacity,                                                                              ! - Heating design capacity method
   autosize,                                                                                           ! - Heating design capacity (W)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Heating design capacity per floor area (W/m2)
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Fraction of auto-sized heating capacity
   VAV;                                                                                                ! - Central cooling capacity control method

AirLoopHVAC,
   Air Loop,                                                                                           ! - Name of loop
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Controller list name
   Air Loop AvailabilityManager List,                                                                  ! - Availability manager list
   autosize,                                                                                           ! - Design supply air flow rate (m3/s)
   Air Loop Branches,                                                                                  ! - Branch list
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Connector list
   Air Loop Supply Side Inlet,                                                                         ! - Supply side inlet node
   Air Loop Demand Side Outlet,                                                                        ! - Demand side outlet node
   Air Loop Demand Side Inlet List,                                                                    ! - Demand side inlet nodes
   Air Loop Supply Side Outlet List,                                                                   ! - Supply side outlet nodes
   1.000;                                                                                              ! - Design return air flow fraction of supply air flow

NodeList,
   Air Loop Demand Side Inlet List,                                                                    ! - Demand side oulet nodes
   Air Loop Demand Side Inlet 1;                                                                       ! - Demand side inlet node 1

NodeList,
   Air Loop Supply Side Outlet List,                                                                   ! - Supply side oulet nodes
   Air Loop Supply Side Outlet 1;                                                                      ! - Supply side outlet node 1

AirLoopHVAC:SupplyPath,
   Air Loop Demand Side Supply Path 1,                                                                 ! - Name of supply path
   Air Loop Demand Side Inlet 1,                                                                       ! - Name of supply path 1 inlet node,
   AirLoopHVAC:ZoneSplitter,                                                                           ! - Component 1 object type
   Air Loop Zone Splitter;                                                                             ! - Component 1 object name

AirLoopHVAC:ZoneSplitter,
   Air Loop Zone Splitter,                                                                             ! - Zone splitter name
   Air Loop Demand Side Inlet 1,                                                                       ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 1,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 2,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 3,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 4,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 5,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 6,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 7,                                                               ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Splitter Outlet Node 8;                                                               ! - Outlet node name

AirLoopHVAC:ReturnPath,
   Air Loop Demand Side Return Path,                                                                   ! - Name of return path
   Air Loop Demand Side Outlet,                                                                        ! - Name of return path outlet node
   AirLoopHVAC:ZoneMixer,                                                                              ! - Component 1 object type
   Air Loop Zone Mixer;                                                                                ! - Component 1 object name

AirLoopHVAC:ZoneMixer,
   Air Loop Zone Mixer,                                                                                ! - Zone mixer name
   Air Loop Demand Side Outlet,                                                                        ! - Outlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 1,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 2,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 3,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 4,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 5,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 6,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 7,                                                                   ! - Inlet node name
   Air Loop Zone Mixer Inlet Node 8;                                                                   ! - Inlet node name

BranchList,
   Air Loop Branches,                                                                                  ! - Name of branch list
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Main Branch;                                                           ! - Name of branch 1

Branch,
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Main Branch,                                                           ! - Branch name
   ,                                                                                                   ! - Pressure drop curve name
   AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem,                                                                       ! - Component 1 object type
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Outdoor air system,                                                    ! - Component 1 name
   Air Loop Supply Side Inlet,                                                                         ! - Component 1 inlet node name
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Mixed Air Outlet,                                                      ! - Component 1 outlet node name
   AirLoopHVAC:UnitaryHeatPump:AirToAir,                                                               ! - Component 2 object type
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir,                                                                       ! - Component 2 name
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Mixed Air Outlet,                                                      ! - Component 2 inlet node name
   Air Loop Supply Side Outlet 1;                                                                      ! - Component 2 outlet node name

OutdoorAir:Nodelist,
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Outdoor Air Inlet;                                                     ! - Outside air node

AirLoopHVAC:OutdoorAirSystem,
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Outdoor air system,                                                    ! - Outside air system name
   Air Loop Unitary HP AirToAir Outdoor air Controller List,                                           ! - Outside air system controller list
